{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1780","id":4162555004,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p874G4x8","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1780","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1780.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1780.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1780","number":1780,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Produce visually reviewed P4-03 Momentum shard","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1774\n\n## Why\n\nThe cumulative Paper 4 semantic release stopped at P4-02, so Momentum parts remained unenriched even though their authenticated structural bundles and original QP/MS images were available. Momentum questions are especially sensitive to visible direction, reversal, coalescence, separation, and sign-branch evidence; treating OCR order or the word `collide` as authority would misclassify mixed and incidental cases.\n\n## What changed\n\n- binds exact-main P4-02 predecessor `9b265126c72a3fd974f2515673ea30bff5333ab6` / tree `8835f62a0d3bba72b40166e8a0bd99f0f5b3cc3f`\n- adds the admitted P4-03 `ProducerConfig` provider and immutable Momentum reviewed source/delta\n- advances the same cumulative P4 projection and active manifest to `P4-03` / `p4-cumulative-v3`\n- classifies all 39 Momentum questions and all 108 QuestionParts through an explicit exhaustive mapping that fails closed when a part is unmapped\n- records direct momentum definition separately from collision conservation\n- scopes dual mass/sign/direction and alternative timing paths with explicit `branch_key` values\n- records 17 jointly required Forces, Kinematics, Newton, and Energy supporting ProcedureInstances as candidate-only evidence without `alternative_to` or primary-Family ownership changes\n- reuses exact authenticated P4-02 QuestionType and ProcedureModel registry objects and conserves every embedded reference\n- keeps the visually observed `s17/43/5` meeting as Kinematics candidate-only despite its use of the word “collide”\n- classifies `m20/42/6/d` as an ordinary collision using its visible separated car/trailer and van motion\n- classifies the Energy-only `w20/41/1/b` part as foreign candidate-only\n- replaces Python-version-specific bytecode hashing with source-text provider binding while retaining exact full-source byte admission\n- makes the P4-02 regression validator successor-aware by rebuilding its historical v2 projection in memory instead of requiring P4-02 to remain the active pointer\n\n## Visual custody\n\nThe predecessor-bound worker authenticated and opened the complete original chains for all 39 questions: 57 distinct QP images and 92 distinct MS images. This successor preserved that provenance and independently re-authenticated/reopened the ambiguous high-risk sample covering:\n\n- incidental collision wording without an impact/conservation event\n- two mass-assignment branches\n- reversal before coalescence\n- unspecified post-impact direction with two signed equations\n- wall reversal and the no-recollision relative-speed inequality\n- separated post-collision car/trailer and van motion\n- an Energy-only loss calculation inside a mixed question\n\nAll reviewed parts carry exact portable bundle, path, page, and SHA-256 evidence plus checked-in reviewed-source and builder references. Approved score parts have complete MS review; all direction/topology and text-only approval gates remain zero. No runtime artifact depends on an AO-local absolute path.\n\n## Result\n\n- P4-03 delta: 49 approved, 32 candidate, 27 abstain QuestionParts\n- cumulative: 492 approved, 71 candidate, 754 abstain QuestionParts\n- visual cumulative: 286 questions, 753 parts, 419 QP images, 603 MS images\n- procedures: 19 models, 648 instances, 85 supporting instances, 68 explicit alternative branches\n- cross-Family evidence: 17 supporting instances, all candidate-only and non-alternative\n- registry conservation: 563/563 typed QuestionParts and 648/648 ProcedureInstances resolve to byte-equivalent canonical objects\n- cache custody: 2 requests, 2 raw authentications, 1 miss/build and 1 authenticated hit\n- remaining P4: 194 questions, 564 parts (403 score-owning, 161 instruction-only)\n- deterministic cumulative rebuild: PASS\n- P4-02 reviewed source/delta SHA-256 preservation: PASS\n- historical authority changes, candidate leakage, unscoped alternatives, topology without pixels, predecessor mutation, structural copies, ownership conflicts, and remote writes: 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1774_p4_momentum_semantic_kg.py --check`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1772_p4_forces_equilibrium_semantic_kg.test.py`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1773_p4_kinematics_semantic_kg.test.py`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1774_p4_momentum_semantic_kg.test.py`\n- total focused/regression tests: 88/88 PASS\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (expected dirty-worktree warning before commit; artifact guard and A+ ratchet healthy)\n","created_at":"2026-07-29T16:57:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T17:57:08Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T17:51:02Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T17:51:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"2b6ebca321b06bc11dbf10acf93aa065f33d9f73","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1780/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1780/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1780/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/07be6f722780ba302c9d1b9759f3b70eb2e0de07","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1774-p4-03-momentum-visual-production","ref":"task/1774-p4-03-momentum-visual-production","sha":"07be6f722780ba302c9d1b9759f3b70eb2e0de07","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy